stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Read
  Read --> Missing
  Read --> Invalid: malformed / read error
  Read --> Decoded
  Decoded --> RecoveryInstalled: runtime / valid recovery / install once
  Decoded --> Cleared: runtime / invalid recovery / clear once
  Missing --> Cleared: runtime / clear once
  Invalid --> Cleared: runtime / clear once
  Decoded --> Projected: auth / zero effects (also recovery-invalid)
  RecoveryInstalled --> Projected
  Cleared --> [*]: no snapshot
  Projected --> [*]
